    "body": "Current-app universal developer preview, app 0.1.1 (build 2).\n\nIncludes Files navigation for folder selection and every scan entry point, including same-folder selection and Command-R from Last Cleanup.\n\nThe ZIP, checksum and manifest are unchanged accepted native Release arm64/x86_64 outputs from d7ba615aae33cb8a2d06a9c878278c6df59137a1. Both slices passed strict ad-hoc signature/production-entitlement and extraction checks. The earlier generated-folder native UI case is carried at its actual source/profile.\n\nAd-hoc preview: no Developer ID/notarization, fresh-Mac/Gatekeeper or Intel runtime acceptance. Do not bypass macOS security controls. See the bundled guide and repository evidence."
